# way (a child plays and touches, an adult talks, an elder keeps it company). The duck lives
# its own day; the family only makes the house sound like people (cues), comes and goes,
# interacts when in its room, answers its calls, picks it up and puts it back. Their own
# random stream (household-v2), separate from the duck's.

